    "title": "Drift No Limit: Car racing",
    "description": "New advanced drift auto simulator. Available as a game in offline mode, and online mode. Sport cars!\r\nOpen world, pedestrians, traffic are all available in the most realistic drift auto simulator with sport cars available in this drift game.\r\nExcellent and realistic game about drifting through the city, a lot of tasks and ways to pump your car or buy new sport drifting car. A wide range of game settings for mobile drift. Dozens of different ways of tuning your car fleet, large pool of tasks both online and offline are available in the game. Free Driving in the city where you can enjoy drifting auto and burning tires on asphalt, blowing smoke in the eyes of opponents in online mode! Drift and have fun on your mobile phone with one of the best games in its genre. Speed! Cars! Drift! Street racing!\r\n\r\nRealistic drifting physics\r\nNext-Gen drift racing graphics on car street racing\r\nDrift No Limit is a multiplayer PvP auto drifting simulator, Pick your car and start drifting solo or PvP against other players and show them who is the drift king.\r\nDrive more than 20 powerful and exciting, highly detailed 3d sport drift cars \r\nRealistic 3D graphics   \r\nThe most realistic drift racing game on mobile devices;\r\nDrift No Limit is the best drift car driving game, thanks to its advanced real physics engine.\r\n\r\nEver wanted to try drift car? Now you can drive, drift and feel a street racing car drive !",
    "descriptionHTML": "New advanced drift auto simulator. Available as a game in offline mode, and online mode. Sport cars!<br>Open world, pedestrians, traffic are all available in the most realistic drift auto simulator with sport cars available in this drift game.<br>Excellent and realistic game about drifting through the city, a lot of tasks and ways to pump your car or buy new sport drifting car. A wide range of game settings for mobile drift. Dozens of different ways of tuning your car fleet, large pool of tasks both online and offline are available in the game. Free Driving in the city where you can enjoy drifting auto and burning tires on asphalt, blowing smoke in the eyes of opponents in online mode! Drift and have fun on your mobile phone with one of the best games in its genre. Speed! Cars! Drift! Street racing!<br><br>Realistic drifting physics<br>Next-Gen drift racing graphics on car street racing<br>Drift No Limit is a multiplayer PvP auto drifting simulator, Pick your car and start drifting solo or PvP against other players and show them who is the drift king.<br>Drive more than 20 powerful and exciting, highly detailed 3d sport drift cars <br>Realistic 3D graphics   <br>The most realistic drift racing game on mobile devices;<br>Drift No Limit is the best drift car driving game, thanks to its advanced real physics engine.<br><br>Ever wanted to try drift car? Now you can drive, drift and feel a street racing car drive !",
